  "rule": "Freeze the S1 sample: 32 SkillsBench v1.1 tasks, 4 per domain, stratified by\npublished difficulty. Selection uses only metadata (category, difficulty) and a\nrecorded seed - never historical skill lift or prior pass rates.\n\nRule (fixed before any model run):\n  * domain = task.md metadata.category (8 values in v1.1), difficulty = metadata.difficulty\n  * only tasks that ship curated skills (environment/skills/ non-empty)\n  * 4 slots per domain split across difficulties proportionally to stratum size\n    (largest remainder; ties -> hard, medium, easy)\n  * within a stratum: sort task ids, shuffle with random.Random(f\"{SEED}:{domain}:{difficulty}\"),\n    take the first k; the rest, in shuffled order, are that stratum's replacement queue\n  * a pre-flight failure is replaced by the next task in its stratum queue; if the queue is\n    empty, by the next task in the domain's other strata (hard, medium, easy order). Logged.",
